  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Folding Fury\n\n\nDeveloped and published by\nMagma Labs\nalex-li.xyz\n2021-2025\n\n\nGame
    Engine\nUnity 6\n\n\nCreative Director\nAlex Li\n\nLead Programmer\nAlex Li\n\n\nLead
    Graphic Designer\nAlex Li\n\nAdditional Graphics\nLimeZu - Office Pack\nLimeZu
    - Modern Exteriors\nYanin Yunus - Pixel Art Carpet\n\n\nUI Designer\nAlex Li\n\nUI
    Programmer\nAlex Li\n\nFonts Used\nMinecraftia\n\n\nLevel Designer\nAlex Li\n\nBoss
    Designer\nAlex Li\n\n\nMusic Composers\nAlex Li\nShinkoNet\n\nSoundtrack\nMenu
    - Sky of Trees\nIn Game - Necron Doom\nBoss Fight - Blockjitsu\nCredits - Drag
    Me Down\n\nSound Effects\nSoundsByDane - 8 bit sound pack\nR0T0R - 8 bit Laser\nSomeGuy22
    - 8 Bit Powerup\n\n\nVoice Actor\nAlex Li\nVoicechanger.io\n\n\nInspiration\nLevel
    Format - Sky Force Reloaded\nModifier System - TETR.IO\nAchievement System -
    TETR.IO\n\nStage 1 - Generic office\nStage 2 - MakerHacks\nStage 3 - Los Altos
    Hacks\nStage 4 - Math Tournament\nStage 5 - Counterspell \nStage 6 - Viking Hacks\nStage
    7 - Middle School\nStage 8 - High School\n\n\nMentors\nGeorge Tsirigotis\nJolie
    Han\nLaurier Ke\nLydia Lei\nMatthew Xu\nQinzhao Li\nRichard Zhang\nRohan Naphade\nTed
    McLeod\nWinfred Lin\n\n\nSpecial Thanks\nAidan Tian\nAndrea Wang\nBrandon Young\nEthan
    Chu\nGrace Nam\nIurii Kirpichev\n\n\n\u201CThey have skill, you don\u2019t\u201D\n\n\u201CWhy
    are you so salty\u201D\n\n\u201CYou started it, he only have you what you deserved\u201D\n\n\"Stop
    making it your whole personality\"\n\n\u201CIt\u2019s your problem, not mine\u201D\n\n\u201CNo
    one cares what you are doing\u201D\n\n\u201CStop playing the victim\u201D\n\n\u201CNobody
    will play your game\u201D\n\n\nIn a time when nobody supported me\u2026\n\n\u201CIn
    retrospect, the ground you stood on never existed in the first place\u201D \n-
    TETR.IO Freefall\n\n\nI rebuilt myself from the bottom up\u2026\n\n\u201CWhen
    the outside world fails you, trust the voice within to light a path\u201D \n-
    TETR.IO The Hermit\n\n\nAnd I developed this game, all by myself\u2026\n\n\u201CIn
    a rigged game, your mind is the only fair advantage\u201D\n- TETR.IO Loaded Dice\n\n\nFolding
    Fury\nMagma Labs\nalex-li.xyz\n2021-2025\n\n\n\n\n\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1ee00de078b884e49bc5c2571c5bf901, type: 2}
