--- !u!114 &847339826
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 847339820}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e38413fc00f254c61999b382e69b0621, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  audio: {fileID: 0}
  textComponent: {fileID: 968596123}
  lines:
  - 'Operator: Nice to see you. Move your mouse to control your character.'
  - "Operator: Hmmm, this form isn\u2019t great for attacking. Try pressing the 4
    key."
  - "Matvey: I wonder what this red button does\u2026"
  - 'Operator: Oh no, it seems like Matvey has activated blackout. Stay on high alert.'
  - Why are we still playing this game? Are you not gonna give up?
  - 'Operator: Oh no, you should get out of there right now!'
  - 'Operator: Welcome to the offices. Get in and get out, and be careful not to
    get spotted.'
  - "Matvey: My name is Matvey Yeltsin. You should know why I\u2019m here."
  - 'Matvey: This is not over.'
  - "Operator: I wasn\u2019t expecting him to be here. Handle this quickly."
  - "Operator: This place is loaded with supplies\u2026 and traps. Be careful!"
  - 'Matvey: Revenge will be mine. Prepare to die!'
  - 'Matvey: Why are you so salty?'
  - 'Operator: This place is quite busy, so try not to be killed.'
  - "Operator: It\u2019s oddly empty here. I don\u2019t like that."
  - "Matvey: You started it, I\u2019m only giving you what you deserve"
  - 'Matvey: This cannot be happening!'
  - "Operator: Welcome to the resistance. Matvey can\u2019t harm you here, but his
    minions are everywhere. "
  - 'Operator: This place seems oddly familiar. You should be fine, but keep your
    eyes out for traps.'
  - "Matvey: Fifth time\u2019s the charm"
  - "Matvey: It\u2019s your problem, not mine"
  - "Operator: The resistance is growing, but we\u2019re still far from defeating
    Matvey. "
  - 'Operator: Be careful around here, I was attacked by Matvey in this exact location. '
  - 'Matvey: I keep seeing you around here. Have you accepted your fate?'
  - 'Matvey: Stop playing the victim'
  - "Operator: It\u2019s about time we end this, once and for all. "
  - "Operator: We\u2019re nearing Matvey\u2019s final resting place. Approach with
    caution."
  - 'Matvey: This is your final battle. I will destroy you!'
  - 'Matvey: Why are you so difficult?'
  - 'Matvey: Die! Die! Die! Die!'
  - "Matvey: Nobody cares anyway! It\u2019s just a stupid game."
  - 'Operator: That thing looks scary, good luck!'
  sounds:
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: f53a50be470fd4fb0957b74199e81933, type: 3}
